Map:map_pk_starkhorn_plateau/Desc
"High upon the slopes of Starkhorn in the White Mountains, a wide plateau lies between snow and stone. Meltwater streams fall from the peak into a great waterfall below. \n Enable ring heroes to active the Cave System. \n Map by Powerkartoffel, August 2025"
END
